<title>GREECE: ORION FUND SETS 50 DRS/SHARE INTERIM DIV.</title>
<headline>ORION FUND SETS 50 DRS/SHARE INTERIM DIV.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek closed-end trust Orion Fund will distribute an interim dividend per share of 50 drachmas, it said in a statement without giving an ex-dividend date.</p>
<p>First-half net profit reached 180.9 million drachmas compared to year-earlier 23 million, it said.</p>
<p>As of July 15, 1997 the fund's net asset value per share stood at 1,217.8 drachmas versus a market price of 1,000 drachmas, it said. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
